  "question": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/76f96904-9539-4267-91d9-d9a9669cf502-image.png\" style=\"width: 337px; height: 113px;\" /></p><p>Consider the above reaction where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of&nbsp;benzoic acid is used to get <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of&nbsp;m-bromo&nbsp;benzoic acid. The percentage yield of the product is ___ .</p><p>(Round off to the Nearest integer)</p><p>[Given : Atomic masses : <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Br</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math>]</p>",
